{
  "@@locale": "en",
  "updateTitle": "A new version is out",
  "@updateTitle": {"description": "Card at the head of the home card list when the published versionCode is higher than this install. Reuses cancelButton, retry and continueButton. When the download was refused for this device's clock, the card shows clockWrongTitle (red) over clockWrongHelp across its full width, then two buttons under them: dateSettings (primary) and retry, as two equal halves like Renew and Support, or both full width one under the other when dateSettings does not fit in half."},
